; Freed by collecting, not a starter: an Achievement unlock ("mortlake_library", open 100 chests).
; The collector - elites carry his scattered library, so they drop more chests.
; He opens on Folio since 2026-11-09 (.ai/character-fit.md section 6; Eric: "I don't think hollow star feels like a
; good spell for him"): a book paid for by what he gathers, turning a page every cooldown and one more for every orb
; he picks up. Arcane + Darkness, earned by everyone else through the Magpie feat (ten chests in one run); he holds
; it whatever the save owns (Player.GetLevelUpOptions offers a wizard his own opener). His form, the Spirit Mirror
; (pull), moved onto it and deepens Darkness. Hollow Star, his opener before, is nobody's now: a spell anyone can
; earn (Survivor), which he may now fuse into The Taking, since his own spell is no longer one of its parents.
